Hopf problem blueprint — logarithmic transforms chapter.

Section 5 of the paper: the two Kodaira logarithmic transforms that fill the elliptic
points of the base, their bielliptic multiple fibres, and the fundamental-group and
homology data those fibres contribute to the topology of X.
-/

